@startuml sprint2_seq
actor "Manager" as MGR
participant "React App (SPA)" as React
participant "Spring Boot API" as Spring
database "SQL Server DB" as DB

MGR -> React : Clic sur "Planifier Ordre"
React -> Spring : POST /api/production-orders (JSON)
activate Spring
Spring -> Spring : Valider la disponibilité machine
Spring -> DB : INSERT INTO production_orders
activate DB
DB --> Spring : Success & ID
deactivate DB
Spring -> Spring : Déclencher recalcul TRG machine
Spring --> React : HTTP 201 Created (JSON)
deactivate Spring
React --> MGR : Afficher confirmation et ordre planifié
@enduml